The files in data/raw/ and the derived graph database data/ward.rl are
based on the SocioPatterns hospital ward dynamic contact network dataset:

  Vanhems P, Barrat A, Cattuto C, Pinton J-F, Khanafer N, et al. (2013)
  "Estimating Potential Infection Transmission Routes in Hospital Wards
  Using Wearable Proximity Sensors."
  PLoS ONE 8(9): e73970.
  https://doi.org/10.1371/journal.pone.0073970

Dataset source: http://www.sociopatterns.org/datasets/hospital-ward-dynamic-contact-network/

